e9: ask-socket -> frontend closes
	step=s6
	message=async
	status=proposed, pending user review
	note=done, then close
	description=A finally block closes the socket, so the frontend learns the turn is over whether the answer streamed or an error stopped it. The frontend ends the cell run when it reads done.
