e10: ask-socket -> frontend returns
	step=s6
	fragment=break:turn failed
	operand=[ask raised]
	operand_note=Any exception in the turn, such as a missing image or a bad option, becomes one error message. The frontend adds it to the cell as a kernel error would, so Run All stops there.
	note=error: ename, evalue
	status=proposed, pending user review
	description=One except clause covers every failure, including a model refusal and an idle timeout.
